# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@host = https://localhost:55076

### 1. Ask a valid math question — expect 200 OK with AI response
POST {{host}}/api/chat-tutor/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can you explain how to solve for x in the equation 3x + 5 = 20?",
  "studentId": "student-123"
}

### 2. Ask with an empty question — expect 400 Validation Error from validator
POST {{host}}/api/chat-tutor/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "",
  "studentId": "student-123"
}

### 3. Ask without a studentId (optional field) — expect 200 OK
POST {{host}}/api/chat-tutor/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the Pythagorean theorem and how do I use it?"
}